HINT:  This parameter has been replaced by "hg_sysmac.global_table_level" and "hg_sysmac.global_row_level". Set the two parameters separately.
SET hg_sysmac.labelmode = '';
ERROR:  parameter "hg_sysmac.labelmode" is no longer supported
HINT:  This parameter has been replaced by "hg_sysmac.global_table_level" and "hg_sysmac.global_row_level". Set the two parameters separately.
